<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel seeks freight Shuttle restart.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel seeks freight Shuttle restart.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Channel Tunnel operator Eurotunnel SA/Plc said on Thursday it continued to work closely with the Inter Governmental Commission (IGC) to resume freight Shuttle services by mid-June.</p>
</text>
